# Cadaver Lab: "When you unlock this door, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand." Bot1's graveyard holds
# Entomb (not a creature) and Grizzly Bears; Bot2's holds a Grizzly Bears too. Entomb and the opponent's creature card are refused,
# Bot1's own Grizzly Bears is returned.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Defiled Crypt // Cadaver Lab
Entomb
Entomb
Swamp
Grizzly Bears
Memnite
Swamp x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Entomb
Swamp x7
Grizzly Bears
Swamp x11

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet#1.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Defiled Crypt // Cadaver Lab.Cast(Ability: Defiled Crypt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Entomb#1.Cast
Bot1.Search(Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Memnite)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot2.Search(Grizzly Bears)
? Bot2.Graveyard = Entomb; Grizzly Bears
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Defiled Crypt.Activate(Ability: right door)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Graveyard.Grizzly Bears)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Entomb)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Power = 1
? Bot1.Graveyard = Entomb; Entomb; Grizzly Bears; Black Lotus
? Bot2.Graveyard = Entomb; Grizzly Bears

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
